Hardship Letter

To Whom It May Concern,

I write to formally request financial hardship assistance in connection with my loan account numbered __________________________.
At the time my loan was approved on ______________________, my gross monthly income was approximately $__________, and my required monthly loan payment was $______________.
Due to unforeseen circumstances, I am presently without employment income as of __________________________, having been furloughed from my position. As a result, I am no longer able to meet the existing payment obligations under the current loan terms.
Based upon my present financial condition, including reduced income and ongoing necessary living expenses, I respectfully request a temporary modification of my payment arrangement. Specifically, I propose that my monthly payment be reduced from $__________________ to $__________________, to be paid __________________________.
Enclosed herewith are supporting documents demonstrating my current financial hardship and reduced capacity to make payments.
Should you require any additional information or clarification, I may be contacted at __________________________ or __________________________.
Thank you for your time, understanding, and consideration of this request.
Respectfully submitted,

[Signature]

[Printed Name]
Date: __________________________






Final Checklist - Hardship Letter
