Execution
- The letter must be signed. Witnessing or notarization is not required.

Supporting Documentation
- Attach copies of all relevant documents showing the hardship, where applicable.

Copies
- Send the original signed letter to the lender or loan servicer.
- Submit copies of supporting documents unless an original is specifically required.
- Retain a complete copy of the letter and all enclosures for your records.

Additional Guidance
- Sending the letter via a trackable delivery method is strongly recommended.
- Follow up after a reasonable period to confirm receipt and review of the request.
